OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum centre to operate for 'at
OL,4,Aleast three years'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposed asylum centre at a former
OL,7,FRAF station in North Yorkshire would be
OL,8,Fin use for "a minimum of three years"
OL,9,Fif approved, a government minister has
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FThe Home Office is considering using
OL,13,Fthe former RAF Linton-on-Ouse site,
OL,14,Fnear York, to house up to 1,200 asylum
OL,15,Fseekers - although no final decision
OL,16,Fhas been made.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
