OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum centre to operate for 'at
OL,4,Aleast three years'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a letter to North Yorkshire Council
OL,7,Fleader Carl Les, border security and
OL,8,Fasylum minister Anna Turley said if
OL,9,Ftaken forward the site would be run by
OL,10,Fa "specialist provider of asylum
OL,11,Faccommodation" with round-the-clock
OL,12,Fsecurity.
OL,14,FIt was sent after Les wrote to the
OL,15,Fgovernment to confirm a motion - passed
OL,16,Funanimously at full council - opposing
OL,17,Fthe proposed plan.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
